FIX #3: ADDITIONAL SYNTAX CORRECTIONS
================================================================================

DMS Conversion Alignment:
- GETDATE() → clock_timestamp() (used in UpdateProductAsync, DeleteProductAsync)
- NOW() maintained for InsertProductAsync (both NOW() and clock_timestamp() are valid)
- Added "NULLS FIRST" to all ORDER BY clauses (PostgreSQL best practice)
- Ensured all table references include schema prefix
- Ensured all column references use lowercase

Transaction Improvements:
- All transaction methods now use proper async/await patterns
- Transaction disposal handled by 'using' statement
- Explicit commit/rollback handling in try-catch blocks
- Each command properly associated with the transaction

